/// <p>When the user triggers a step whilst holding the <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qt.html#KeyboardModifier-enum" translate="no">Qt::ControlModifier</a>, QAbstractSpinBox steps by 10 instead of making a single step. This step modifier affects wheel events, key events and interaction with the spinbox buttons. Note that on macOS, Control corresponds to the Command key.</p>
