    /// <p>QGridLayout takes the space made available to it (by its parent layout or by the <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qlayout.html#parentWidget" translate="no">parentWidget</a>()), divides it up into rows and columns, and puts each widget it manages into the correct cell.</p>
