/// <p>The anchor layout allows developers to specify how widgets should be placed relative to each other, and to the layout itself. The specification is made by adding anchors to the layout by calling <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qgraphicsanchorlayout.html#addAnchor" translate="no">addAnchor</a>(), <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qgraphicsanchorlayout.html#addAnchors" translate="no">addAnchors</a>() or <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qgraphicsanchorlayout.html#addCornerAnchors" translate="no">addCornerAnchors</a>().</p>
