/// <p>QGraphicsWidget is an extended base item that provides extra functionality over <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qgraphicsitem.html" translate="no">QGraphicsItem</a>. It is similar to <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qwidget.html" translate="no">QWidget</a> in many ways:</p>
