/// <p>QItemDelegate can be used to provide custom display features and editor widgets for item views based on <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qabstractitemview.html" translate="no">QAbstractItemView</a> subclasses. Using a delegate for this purpose allows the display and editing mechanisms to be customized and developed independently from the model and view.</p>
