/// <p>QStackedWidget can be used to create a user interface similar to the one provided by <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qtabwidget.html" translate="no">QTabWidget</a>. It is a convenience layout widget built on top of the <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qstackedlayout.html" translate="no">QStackedLayout</a> class.</p>
