/// <p>A tool button's icon is set as <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qicon.html" translate="no">QIcon</a>. This makes it possible to specify different pixmaps for the disabled and active state. The disabled pixmap is used when the button's functionality is not available. The active pixmap is displayed when the button is auto-raised because the mouse pointer is hovering over it.</p>
