    /// <p>The QTreeWidgetItem class is a convenience class that replaces the QListViewItem class in Qt 3. It provides an item for use with the <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qtreewidget.html" translate="no">QTreeWidget</a> class.</p>
