/// <p>QUndoView is a <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qlistview.html" translate="no">QListView</a> which displays the list of commands pushed on an undo stack. The most recently executed command is always selected. Selecting a different command results in a call to <a href="http://doc.qt.io/qt-5/qundostack.html#setIndex" translate="no">QUndoStack::setIndex</a>(), rolling the state of the document backwards or forward to the new command.</p>
